Tr=7 AI Completion SOP
Goal
Complete the two missing blocks of a Tr=7-only SKILL PCell:

R8_ROUTE_BLOCK — Tr=7 routing, input paths, and geometry snapshots.
R10_PINS_BLOCK — terminals P1–P10.
Return only the two replacement code blocks. Do not rewrite the rest of the PCell.

Operating rules
Work as a pure technical derivation assistant.
Use only the constraints in the current prompt and the explicitly supplied interfaces.
Do not read standard-answer files, hidden files, other sessions, or other groups.
Do not invent missing points, bBoxes, VIA pairs, or electrical connections.
Do not implement Tr=5 or Tr=3.
Do not claim SKILL, Virtuoso, OA, PDK, DRC, LVS, EM, or connectivity verification.
Preserve existing variable names and downstream interfaces.
Output static code plus a short list of assumptions and unverified items.
